{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">大埔臨海優質屋苑海日灣憑藉樓齡新、會所設施齊備兼環境寧靜舒適，持續吸引首置客入市。利嘉閣地產大埔-比華利山豪宅分行助理營業董事李栢齡表示，該行團隊精英最新促成大埔海日灣2期12座中層C室的二手成交個案，面積約251呎，採開放式間隔，外望內園景致。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">李栢齡透露，買家原租住單位，見租金持續上漲，有意轉租為買，早前透過網上查詢並經利嘉閣真盤源平台見上述放盤。客人參觀單位後，極為心儀屋苑樓齡新兼保養良好，加上單位景觀開揚舒適，開則方正實用，極為符合個人首置自住需求，睇樓後感到十分滿意，遂決定以412萬元購入上址，折合實用面積呎價約16,414元，屬市場合理水平。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">據悉，原業主於2019年以約408.9萬元一手購入上述單位。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T06:18:27.339602+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":311,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}